    "Change the display preset in Displays settings and back, or log out. If another color app was running, quit it. Settings ▸ Advanced ▸ Reset Display Colors can also help." : {
      "comment" : "Help: answer about a display that looks wrong",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Change the display preset in Displays settings and back, or log out. If another color app was running, quit it. Settings ▸ Advanced ▸ Reset Display Colors can also help."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Change the display preset in Displays settings and back, or log out. If another color app was running, quit it. Settings ▸ Advanced ▸ Reset Display Colors can also help."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "V nastavení Monitory změňte předvolbu monitoru a pak ji vraťte zpět, případně se odhlaste. Pokud byla spuštěná jiná aplikace pro barvy, ukončete ji. Pomoci může i Nastavení ▸ Pokročilé ▸ Resetovat barvy monitorů."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
