    "If the menu bar is full or macOS hides the icon, open Overbright from Finder or Spotlight to see Settings. In Menu Bar settings, check that Overbright is turned on under Allow in the Menu Bar." : {
      "comment" : "Help: answer about a hidden menu bar icon",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "If the menu bar is full or macOS hides the icon, open Overbright from Finder or Spotlight to see Settings. In Menu Bar settings, check that Overbright is turned on under Allow in the Menu Bar."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "If the menu bar is full or macOS hides the icon, open Overbright from Finder or Spotlight to see Settings. In Menu Bar settings, check that Overbright is turned on under Allow in the Menu Bar."
          }
        },
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pokud je řádek nabídek plný nebo macOS ikonu skrývá, otevřete Overbright z Finderu nebo pomocí Spotlightu a zobrazí se Nastavení. V nastavení Řádek nabídek zkontrolujte, že je Overbright zapnutý v seznamu Povolit v řádku nabídek."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
