            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Turn the display brightness all the way up; Overbright adds to it. Check the display’s verdict in Settings ▸ Displays. On a MacBook Pro, use the 1600-nit preset. On some Macs, macOS ignores color table changes: choose Calibrate… to check, or try Compatibility mode. Run Self-Test… shows what macOS reports."
          }
        },
