    "While extra brightness is on, HDR highlights can’t go above the brightened white. Overbright pauses for full-screen video and for video players; add other apps in Settings ▸ Automations." : {
      "comment" : "Help: answer about washed-out colors",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "While extra brightness is on, HDR highlights can’t go above the brightened white. Overbright pauses for full-screen video and for video players; add other apps in Settings ▸ Automations."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
