    "macOS decides how much extra range a display gets. It gives less when the surroundings are already bright, the display is warm or the battery is low. The chip on each display says what limits it." : {
      "comment" : "Help: answer about limits",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "macOS decides how much extra range a display gets. It gives less when the surroundings are already bright, the display is warm or the battery is low. The chip on each display says what limits it."
          }
        },
        "ca" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
